# (An exemption for `v1-roadmap.md` lived here. That file was moved to Notion in
# 4834eb4, and check-layout.sh's ALLOWED_ROOT_MD now rejects it at the root, so
# the rule granted an exemption to a state that is a layout violation.)

# Evidence logs are CAPTURED TOOL OUTPUT, not authored source. ngspice emits
# trailing whitespace ("Total elapsed time (seconds) = 0.241 ") and normalizing
# it would edit a verbatim transcript to suit a lint rule — which is the wrong
# way round for a file whose whole job is to be what the tool actually printed.
**/validation.log -whitespace
